OL,3,GNEWSARNLI 'tombstoning' warning after
OL,4,Asummer increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RNLI has issued a warning about the
OL,7,Fdangers of "tombstoning" after it said
OL,8,Fit has seen an increase the act over
OL,9,Fthe course of summer.
OL,11,FTombstoning is the dangerous act of
OL,12,Fjumping or diving upright from a high
OL,13,Fledge, cliff, pier or bridge into water
OL,14,Fof unknown depth, or which might have
OL,15,Fobjects below the surface.
OL,17,FGuy Addington, regional water safety
OL,18,Flead at the RNLI, told BBC Radio Kent
OL,19,Fthat the organisation recommended not
OL,20,Fdoing it but "of course, we know it
OL,21,Fgoes on".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
